. Yankee.'\\\" Woods even appeared to believe that Chungpa Han was not a fictional character but actually Kang's real name, writing that Kang was \\\"born Chungpa Han thirty-four years ago in a Korean village.\\\" Woods declared that Kang \\\"has been so successfully Americanized as to become\\\" an ... \",\"title\":\"https://projects.iq.harvard.edu/koreanalumnibiographiesproject/people/younghill-kang\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d71\"},\"ref\":\"d71\",\"snippet\":\" ... Hyung Koo Kang: The Burning Gaze\\n\\nHyung Koo Kang: The Burning Gaze\\n\\nPaperback, 120 pages\\n\\nRetail Price: $25\\n\\nISBN: 978-981-08-9994-3\\n\\nHyung Koo Kang: The Burning Gaze documents and charts the practice of the highly regarded artist that has spanned over two decades. An interview ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.singaporeartmuseum.sg/About/Publications\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d82\"},\"ref\":\"d82\",\"snippet\":\" ... and screenwriter\\n*October 27 – Jonathan Stroud, English fantasy writer\\n*November 7 – Chris Adrian, American novelist\\n*November 24 – Marlon James, Jamaican novelist\\n*November 27 – Han Kang, South Korean novelist\\n*December 21 – Mohamedou Ould Salahi, Mauritanian author and former Guantánamo detainee \\n*unknown dates\\n**Raja'a Alem, Saudi Arabian writer\\n**Roberta ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1970_in_literature\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"8127b1aa1cce82dc61b838448d420fe70ea8a8facf3e9f299d3c63b58fefad80\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"7b7d3caf34efc591e13129ddbb66442bf1c0a2b4a8209a02c3f4ae3877eff7cf\",\"semantic_progress\":\